        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "c99058ff-7bfd-5e32-907c-f86dca6da103",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Howard Bilerman, Vic Chesnutt\n- Organizations: Arcade Fire, Thee Silver Mt. Zion Memorial Orchestra & Tra-La-La Band\n- Products: Funeral\n- Topics: music recording, drumming, singer-songwriters\n\nFacts:\n- James Victor Chesnutt was born on November 12, 1964, and he was an American singer-songwriter from Athens, Georgia.\n- Howard Bilerman was a former member of Arcade Fire and recorded and played drums on the band's debut album Funeral.\n- Howard Bilerman also recorded on releases by Thee Silver Mt. Zion Memorial Orchestra & Tra-La-La Band, Vic Chesnutt, Basia Bulat, Peter Peter, Rich Aucoin, and Angela Desveaux.\n- Vic Chesnutt died on December 25, 2009.",
